ction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Waterdeep?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        Waterdeep is the bustling City of Splendors on the <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast\" class=\"entity-link\">Sword Coast</a>, a hub of trade, intrigue, and adventuring guilds in the <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms\" class=\"entity-link\">Forgotten Realms</a>.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p class=\"also-known-as\">\n        <strong>Also known as:</strong>\n        City of Splendors, Waterdeep city.\n    </p>\n\n</section>","word_count":305,"uniqueness_score":"0.5260"},"entity":{"id":"bed9c897-2749-4e90-8534-e1ed71a856ee","name":"Waterdeep","slug":"waterdeep","type":"place","short_description":"City of Splendors on the Sword Coast.","description":"Waterdeep is the bustling City of Splendors on the Sword Coast, a hub of trade, intrigue, and adventuring guilds in the Forgotten Realms.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"dungeons-and-dragons","aliases":["City of Splendors","Waterdeep city"],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/forgottenrealms/images/6/6b/Waterdeep_symbol_5e.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/360?cb=20230315214656","image_source":"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Waterdeep","image_credit":"Fair-use identification thumbnail via Fandom. Character / franchise art © Wizards of the Coast / Hasbro (as applicable). Not free or redistributable artwork.","image_license":"fair_use","image_usage":"fair_use_identification","image_alt":"Identification thumbnail for Waterdeep"},"connections":[{"id":"d71713b7-24aa-447e-9ab5-4efe63ce6f7b","relationship":"located_in","title":"Waterdeep lies on the Sword Coast.","explanation":null,"strength":"0.9800","discovery_score":"0.9600","direction":"outgoing","from_entity_id":"bed9c897-2749-4e90-8534-e1ed71a856ee","to_entity_id":"01f3ca3a-eed8-4b25-832b-62c34886880d","entity_id":"01f3ca3a-eed8-4b25-832b-